name: Per-case historical spending review preserves work and approved allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resource-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 job(s) | unapproved-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | resource-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Full plan historical scenario | historical-scenario
expect: 6 to 6 provider requests
expect: Dollar estimate: unavailable
ask: Does the preview distinguish the six-call historical scenario from future spending bounds and retain unknown prices and protected Review?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 HISTORICAL USAGE | prior-study-picker
resize: 160x48
live-snap: picker-160x48
expect: Esc back
resize: 96x89
live-snap: picker-96x89
expect: Esc back
resize: 80x24
live-snap: picker-80x24
expect: Esc back
resize: 60x20
live-snap: picker-60x20
expect: Esc back
resize: 40x12
live-snap: picker-40x12
expect: Esc back
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
live-snap: picker-detail-tail
ask: Can the operator inspect, page and cancel a named prior study without changing the plan, draft or spending?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | picker-cancelled
keys: Up Up Up Enter
type: 14
keys: Enter L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | review-proposed-limits
expect: Full plan historical scenario
expect: 6 context/scan calls available
expect: Total provider calls: 14
ask: Does the exact approval include the complete scenario, consumed calls and protected Review without claiming a dollar ceiling or starting jobs?
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | cancelled-approval
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reviewed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resource-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 job(s) | recovered-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 Full plan historical scenario | recovered-scenario
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/resource_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the exact prior study and frozen per-case observations while leaving its six paid fixture calls and unapproved new work unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
